id: 15
hanzi: 装修
pinyin: zhuāng xiū
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to decorate; to renovate; to fit out (an interior); interior decoration
  es: renovar; remodelar; decorar (una vivienda); decoración de interiores

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to renovate, decorate, and install fixtures in a building or apartment | reformar; remodelar o decorar los interiores de un inmueble | 装修新房 (renovate a new apartment)
  2 | Noun | Standard | interior decoration, renovation works, or fit-out | reforma; obras de decoración interior | 豪华装修 (luxurious interior decor)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 新买的房子刚装修完，为了家人的身体健康，母亲特意让窗户大开通风散味了整整三个月。 | Xīn mǎi de fángzi gāng zhuāngxiū wán, wèile jiārén de shēntǐ jiànkāng, mǔqīn tèyì ràng chuānghu dà kāi tōngfēng sǎnwèi le zhěngzhěng sān gè yuè. | The newly purchased apartment had just finished being renovated; for the family's health, mother deliberately kept the windows wide open to ventilate for three full months. | El piso recién comprado acababa de reformarse; por la salud de la familia, mi madre dejó las ventanas abiertas de par en par durante tres meses para ventilarlo.
  #2 | 该连锁酒店聘请了国际知名设计团队进行室内装修升级，全面融入环保建材与智能化客房控制系统。 | Gāi liánsuǒ jiǔdiàn pìnqǐng le guójì zhīmíng shèjì tuánduì jìnxíng shìnèi zhuāngxiū shēngjí, quánmiàn róngrù huánbǎo jiàncái yǔ zhìnénghuà kèfáng kòngzhì xìtǒng. | The hotel chain hired an internationally renowned design team to upgrade its interior renovation, integrating eco-friendly materials and smart room controls. | La cadena hotelera contrató a un célebre equipo de diseño para renovar la decoración interior, incorporando materiales ecológicos y domótica avanzada.

